<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-sanguozhi" book-id="b-sanguozhi-059" chapter-id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal" source-id="s-sanguozhi-059-appraisal">
  <p id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">評曰：<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0003" ref="572_278_cba_C">孫登</persName>居心所存，足爲茂美之德。<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0017" ref="572_278_cba_D">慮</persName>、<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0019" ref="572_278_cba_A">和</persName>並有好善之姿，規自砥礪，或短命早終，或不得其死，哀哉！<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0047" ref="572_278_cba_B">霸</persName>以庶干適，<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0053" ref="572_278_cba_E">奮</persName>不遵軌度，固取危亡之道也。然<persName id="c-sanguozhi-059-appraisal:line053:m0068" ref="572_278_cba_E">奮</persName>之誅夷，橫遇飛禍矣。</p>
</text>
